{"declarations":[{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Sym/Arith/Norm.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.Arith.normalize?\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Sym</span>.<span class=\"name\">Arith</span>.<span class=\"name\">normalize?</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">m</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a> → <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a></span>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Monad\">Monad</a> <span class=\"fn\">m</span></span>]</span></span> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#MonadLiftT\">MonadLiftT</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Sym/SymM.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.SymM\">SymM</a> <span class=\"fn\">m</span></span>]</span></span> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#MonadLiftT\">MonadLiftT</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Basic.html#Lean.Meta.MetaM\">MetaM</a> <span class=\"fn\">m</span></span>]</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">e</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">simpAtom</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a> → <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">m</span> <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Sym/Simp/SimpM.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.Simp.Result\">Simp.Result</a></span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">discharge?</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a> → <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">m</span> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a>)</span></span></span> := <span class=\"fn\">fun (<span class=\"fn\">x</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a>) =&gt; <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Pure.pure\">pure</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option.none\">none</a></span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">lhsOnly</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a> := <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool.false\">false</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">distrib</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a> := <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool.true\">true</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">m</span> <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Sym/Simp/SimpM.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.Simp.Result\">Simp.Result</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Normalizes `e` into polynomial normal form after simplifying its atoms with `simpAtom`:\neither an arithmetic term (see `normalizeTerm?`), a relation `lhs = rhs`, `lhs ≤ rhs`,\n`lhs < rhs` whose carrier type is a `CommRing` or `CommSemiring` (see \"Relations\"), or an\n`Int` divisibility constraint `k ∣ e` with a numeral `k` (see `normalizeDvd?`).\n`e` must be maximally shared. The result cases are those of `normalizeTerm?`. A normalized\nrelation is `done` as well; a simplifier that wants `post` to see normalized relations (to\nclose `t = t`, say) must apply it itself, as `Sym.Simp.simpArith` does.\n\n`discharge?` is asked for the side conditions `x ≠ 0` under which `x * x⁻¹` is cancelled in a\nfield; by default none is proved.\n\nWith `lhsOnly := true`, a relation over a ring is normalized to `p = 0`, `p ≤ 0`, or `p < 0`\nwith `p` the polynomial of `lhs - rhs`, instead of being split by sign (see \"Relations\"); the\nexceptions follow `simp +arith`: equations between atoms and numerals (`x = y`, `x = 3`,\n`3 = x`) and equations already of the form `p = 0` are left alone, and `x - y = 0` and\n`x + k = 0` are written `x = y` and `x = -k`. This is the normal form of the `grind`\nnormalizer. Semirings have no subtraction and are unaffected.\n\nWith `distrib := false`, multiplication is not distributed over addition: a product is\nexpanded only when one factor is a scalar (a constant, or a numeral inverse in a field of\ncharacteristic zero) or both are monomials, a power only when its base is a monomial, and in a\nfield `(a * b)⁻¹` and `(a ^ n)⁻¹` are not rewritten. Any other product, power, or inverse is an\natom whose factors are normalized separately, so `x * (y + 1)` stays `x * (y + 1)` while\n`2 * (y + 1)` becomes `2 * y + 2`. This keeps the nonlinear atoms that decision procedures for\nlinear arithmetic see, as a simplifier that only linearizes would.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Sym/Arith/Norm.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.Arith.normalize?","kind":"def","line":1392,"name":"Lean.Meta.Sym.Arith.normalize?","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c9afcddf514a6772bd4d649f7cfc04eff0b9f15e/src/Lean/Meta/Sym/Arith/Norm.lean#L1392-L1432"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Sym/Arith/Norm.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.Arith.instBEqRelKind.beq\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Sym</span>.<span class=\"name\">Arith</span>.<span class=\"name\">instBEqRelKind</span>.<span class=\"name\">beq</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Sym/Arith/Norm.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.Arith.RelKind\">RelKind</a> → <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Sym/Arith/Norm.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.Arith.RelKind\">RelKind</a> → <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Sym/Arith/Norm.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.Arith.instBEqRelKind.beq","kind":"def","line":933,"name":"Lean.Meta.Sym.Arith.instBEqRelKind.beq","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c9afcddf514a6772bd4d649f7cfc04eff0b9f15e/src/Lean/Meta/Sym/Arith/Norm.lean#L933-L933"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">instance</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Sym/Arith/Norm.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.Arith.instBEqRelKind\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Sym</span>.<span class=\"name\">Arith</span>.<span class=\"name\">instBEqRelKind</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#BEq\">BEq</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Sym/Arith/Norm.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.Arith.RelKind\">RelKind</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Sym/Arith/Norm.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.Arith.instBEqRelKind","kind":"instance","line":933,"name":"Lean.Meta.Sym.Arith.instBEqRelKind","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c9afcddf514a6772bd4d649f7cfc04eff0b9f15e/src/Lean/Meta/Sym/Arith/Norm.lean#L933-L933"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">instance</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Sym/Arith/Norm.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.Arith.instInhabitedRelKind\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Sym</span>.<span class=\"name\">Arith</span>.<span class=\"name\">instInhabitedRelKind</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Inhabited\">Inhabited</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Sym/Arith/Norm.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.Arith.RelKind\">RelKind</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Sym/Arith/Norm.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.Arith.instInhabitedRelKind","kind":"instance","line":933,"name":"Lean.Meta.Sym.Arith.instInhabitedRelKind","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c9afcddf514a6772bd4d649f7cfc04eff0b9f15e/src/Lean/Meta/Sym/Arith/Norm.lean#L933-L933"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">constructor</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Sym/Arith/Norm.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.Arith.RelKind.lt\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Sym</span>.<span class=\"name\">Arith</span>.<span class=\"name\">RelKind</span>.<span class=\"name\">lt</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Sym/Arith/Norm.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.Arith.RelKind\">RelKind</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Sym/Arith/Norm.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.Arith.RelKind.lt","kind":"ctor","line":932,"name":"Lean.Meta.Sym.Arith.RelKind.lt","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c9afcddf514a6772bd4d649f7cfc04eff0b9f15e/src/Lean/Meta/Sym/Arith/Norm.lean#L932-L932"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">constructor</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Sym/Arith/Norm.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.Arith.RelKind.le\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Sym</span>.<span class=\"name\">Arith</span>.<span class=\"name\">RelKind</span>.<span class=\"name\">le</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Sym/Arith/Norm.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.Arith.RelKind\">RelKind</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Sym/Arith/Norm.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.Arith.RelKind.le","kind":"ctor","line":932,"name":"Lean.Meta.Sym.Arith.RelKind.le","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c9afcddf514a6772bd4d649f7cfc04eff0b9f15e/src/Lean/Meta/Sym/Arith/Norm.lean#L932-L932"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\"